WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — Revenge of the Wave God — Episode 14 — English subtitles — translation of the actual spoken Arabic dialogue (language: en)
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-24 from the real episode audio (whisper-small + manual cleanup).

1
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:08.480
I didn't have to forgive you.

2
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:13.360
But you acted like a madman.

3
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.360
You were about to kill him.

4
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:20.530
Do you have anything to say?

5
00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:22.530
Why were you in his hotel room?

6
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:26.450
He spilled a drink on me.

7
00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:28.450
I should have been there.

8
00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:30.450
But you refused her.

9
00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:32.450
I wanted you to save me. Why didn't you?

10
00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:34.450
You always do this.

11
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:37.450
Then you complain when I don't tell you what to do.

12
00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:39.450
Act like a man for once.

13
00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:43.450
You used to love me for being kind and generous.

14
00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:44.450
No.

15
00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:47.450
I loved how fierce you were with me the first time.

16
00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:50.450
I was completely out of it, and I made a big mistake.

17
00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:54.450
Is that how you feel about our marriage?

18
00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:59.840
You're kind, Fares.

19
00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:01.840
But I need a strong man.

20
00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:03.840
Not a coward.

21
00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:07.180
If you looked closely,

22
00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:09.180
you'd see the truth:

23
00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:12.180
you won't succeed without me.

24
00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:15.530
Be realistic, Fares.

25
00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:18.530
I can cook my own meals and take care of myself.

26
00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:23.700
I let you do that because you're pitiful.

27
00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.700
I pity you.

28
00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:28.700
You think I'm just a servant in this house?

29
00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:29.700
As you said.

30
00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:30.700
Indeed.

31
00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:32.700
I need a real man.

32
00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.700
Not just

33
00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:37.700
a failure who lacks manhood.

34
00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:40.700
What you do makes you look weak.

35
00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.700
How am I supposed to be attracted to you?

36
00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:48.800
Then let's get divorced.
